Since $\angle AO_1 S = 58^\circ$, $\angle AO_1 R = 180^\circ - 58^\circ = 122^\circ$.  Since $\angle BO_2 T = 37^\circ$, $\angle BO_2 R = 180^\circ - 37^\circ = 143^\circ$.

